%abc-2.1
% CC0 1.0: written for this repo, no rights reserved. Two hands in 4/4 at a quarter = 120, then
% from bar 3 a quarter = 60, then from bar 5 in 3/4: the beat lines spread out with the tempo and
% follow the meter.
X:1
T:Beat lines with a tempo change
M:4/4
L:1/4
Q:1/4=120
K:C
V:1 clef=treble name="Right hand"
V:2 clef=bass name="Left hand"
V:1
c4|e4|[Q:1/4=60]g4|e4|[M:3/4]c3|e3|]
V:2
C,4|G,,4|[Q:1/4=60]C,4|G,,4|[M:3/4]C,3|G,,3|]
